00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.626
Ugh.

00:18:14.659 --> 00:18:16.128
Joe, I'm sorry.

00:18:17.428 --> 00:18:20.265 align:start size:41% position:59%
Oh, Joe. Joe.

00:18:20.298 --> 00:18:23.102
[music playing]

00:18:27.906 --> 00:18:31.310 align:start size:63% position:38%
Now, how did it feel
to smash Aaron?

