00:18:43.321 --> 00:18:44.456
instantly,
I grew attached to it,

00:18:44.489 --> 00:18:45.857
because when I put it
in my hand,

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:46.925
I felt its energy.

00:18:46.958 --> 00:18:48.693
I'm sorry, Joe.

00:18:48.726 --> 00:18:50.595
- Do you feel bad?
- I do.

00:18:50.628 --> 00:18:51.663 size:75% position:38%
I do feel bad about Joe.

00:18:51.696 --> 00:18:53.698 align:start position:0%
He was pretty cool.

00:18:53.731 --> 00:18:55.433
Oh, he's back.

00:18:55.466 --> 00:18:56.501 align:start size:31% position:69%
He's back?

00:18:56.534 --> 00:18:58.303
Pump, pump.

00:18:58.336 --> 00:19:00.172 align:start size:78% position:22%
