00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.708
- No.
- Why not?

00:19:03.741 --> 00:19:05.577 align:start position:0%
I mean, he survived it.
He survived it once.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:08.180 size:81% position:41%
I'm not gonna do it again.

00:19:08.213 --> 00:19:09.915
[Michael]<i> Clearly,
it doesn't take much for humans</i>

00:19:09.948 --> 00:19:12.918
<i> to become emotionally
 attached to technology.</i>

00:19:12.951 --> 00:19:15.787
<i> But after my ten days
 of video-gaming--</i>

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.622 align:start size:16% position:84%
Nice.

00:19:17.655 --> 00:19:20.559
<i> I was about to find out
 if technology had</i>

00:19:20.592 --> 00:19:22.294
<i> affected my spatial memory</i>

00:19:22.327 --> 00:19:24.396
