Yep. Actually, no,
I don't know.

00:22:58.709 --> 00:23:01.513 align:start position:0%
I'm anxious to see
what your results are.

00:23:01.546 --> 00:23:02.680 align:start size:59% position:41%
I guess let's start
off first

00:23:02.713 --> 00:23:04.783 align:start size:53% position:47%
with the object
recognition task.

00:23:04.816 --> 00:23:08.920 align:start size:81% position:19%
And it's important to note
that in our control test
without video-gaming,

00:23:08.953 --> 00:23:12.190 align:start size:72% position:28%
