 in this task, but...</i>

00:23:12.223 --> 00:23:13.925 align:start size:72% position:28%
your memory got better.

00:23:13.958 --> 00:23:15.460 align:start size:81% position:19%
You went up by ten points.

00:23:15.493 --> 00:23:17.529 align:start size:69% position:31%
Ten points is actually
20 years' worth

00:23:17.562 --> 00:23:20.732 align:start size:50% position:50%
